Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:03.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉又来了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:05.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新的一集马上要开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.11,0:00:07.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了找齐四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.88,0:00:09.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了用这把铁碎牙打败奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.51,0:00:13.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了寻找突然失踪的奈落 一行人展开漫长的旅程
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.71,0:00:15.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家曾经一起度过好多次难关
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.38,0:00:19.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过这次大家又要一起面对心灵的地狱了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.05,0:00:21.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师加上珊瑚 七宝跟云母
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.82,0:00:23.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿梭于时空 发生在战国时代与现代
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:24.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.39,0:00:32.09,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,分散在蓝蓝天空上的 七颗星星{\fad(300,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:36.76,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每一颗星星 都刻着我的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.07,0:00:40.56,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算梦想被粉碎 我也要寻找爱{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.04,0:00:44.67,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无处可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.08,0:00:48.81,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,紧紧抓着我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.05,0:00:57.29,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些骗人的光阴 我再也不会输给它{\fad(0,600)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.36,0:01:02.56,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,睁大眼睛 看清楚这瞬间
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.86,0:01:06.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它仍然紧紧围绕着我们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.03,0:01:10.63,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让人啜泣的 现实生活中
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.04,0:01:14.87,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最重要的…到底是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.21,0:01:18.54,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繁忙的这个世界{\fad(50,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.81,0:01:22.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永恒的碎片 忽隐又忽现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.05,0:01:26.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去触摸 去捕捉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.05,0:01:33.15,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.00,0:01:38.80,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了得到最后的笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.07,0:01:46.03,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就要循着目标继续向前走{\fad(0,1000)}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.90,0:02:10.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样啊 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.17,0:02:12.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到现在还找不到出口吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.47,0:02:14.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别吵了 会分心啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一早到现在都还没搞定 马上就要天黑了耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.21,0:02:23.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛抖个不停啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 这座森林果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.48,0:02:30.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯 不会错了 一定是妖怪的巢穴…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.49,0:02:36.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的 又爆胎了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.02,0:02:37.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.96,0:02:39.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种没用的废物 扔掉算了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.13,0:02:40.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:42.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我妈买给我的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.13,0:02:46.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:47.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一股邪恶的气息…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:48.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.14,0:02:51.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这座森林的主人差不多该现身了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.24,0:02:54.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会出现的会是鬼还是蛇呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.08,0:03:02.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪快点现身吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.25,0:03:03.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么话快说清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:05.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别在那边装模作样了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点给我滚出来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:24.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎光临我这座可悲的森林
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.41,0:03:32.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第100话 真实的恶梦 可悲的森林之役
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.08,0:03:34.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这个家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.75,0:03:36.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 你看这妖怪…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.05,0:03:39.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 是蛾天丸同类
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.55,0:03:42.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦？你们认得蛾天丸那家伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.29,0:03:45.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙是我们族人的耻辱
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:49.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说他跟一些低贱的人类狼狈为奸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.60,0:03:52.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后居然死在半妖的手里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.80,0:03:56.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这把刀还真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:03:58.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.04,0:04:00.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚说的半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.51,0:04:03.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个人就是我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.81,0:04:09.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时那样的结果我还正觉得无趣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.55,0:04:11.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.62,0:04:13.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会有妖怪血的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:20.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这只死妖虫
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.93,0:04:26.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你想帮蛾天丸报仇的话
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.63,0:04:28.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天本大爷会很兴奋的奉陪到底
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.87,0:04:30.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮蛾天丸报仇？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.74,0:04:31.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你别说笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.87,0:04:33.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种邪魔歪道 死了活该
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.07,0:04:35.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会理他那些闲事的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.24,0:04:37.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你爱怎么说都可以
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.64,0:04:41.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对你们这些飞蛾死虫怪也一样没有好感
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.15,0:04:42.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.09,0:04:52.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.66,0:04:53.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.76,0:04:54.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.03,0:04:56.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这…这是什么呀 啊 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:04:58.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太…太大意了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:00.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿不出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.33,0:05:02.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直冲进身体里面去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.84,0:05:03.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,力气…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.11,0:05:07.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,渐渐被吸走…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.91,0:05:08.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.61,0:05:12.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.41,0:05:13.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.92,0:05:17.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,连铁碎牙也不管用
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:23.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会吃人类的鲜血的是那些邪魔歪道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:26.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们全族的人一向吃的都是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.86,0:05:29.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐惧的心 还有脆弱的灵魂呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.93,0:05:32.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.64,0:05:38.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 别被控制了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.64,0:05:39.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂！弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.58,0:05:43.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.88,0:05:45.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要坚强一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.65,0:05:48.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在再大声都没用 臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.22,0:05:50.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们根本就听不见你的声音
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:53.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 回答我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.72,0:05:54.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:56.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用等到天亮
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:57.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那些分身
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.03,0:06:00.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就会把他们的灵魂跟肉体吃个精光了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:09.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤…试试看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.41,0:06:20.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本不管用
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.48,0:06:24.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子只有打败这个妖怪才能解开法术吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.69,0:06:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.92,0:06:30.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在连续不断的恶梦中
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.76,0:06:32.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些隐藏在内心深处的恐惧跟绝望
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.83,0:06:35.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部都给我唤醒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:55.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来呀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.78,0:06:58.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:07.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要紧吧 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.16,0:07:09.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这孩子连云母都比不过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.23,0:07:12.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看他应该还不能应付实战
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:14.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒不这么认为 爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.80,0:07:17.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得琥珀耍链条耍得很好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.90,0:07:19.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你这么说的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.74,0:07:20.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.11,0:07:23.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,万一琥珀有什么危险 还有我跟着
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:39.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:43.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好…可怕…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.50,0:07:48.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 我好害怕哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.07,0:07:51.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了 姐姐在这…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.08,0:08:01.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:09.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愉快 愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.66,0:08:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉怎么样 弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.86,0:08:11.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像这样出来散散心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.93,0:08:13.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那些什么痛苦烦恼的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.36,0:08:14.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就都把它忘了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.86,0:08:17.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梦心师父
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.86,0:08:20.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么没有看见我爸爸在这里呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:23.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梦心师父？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:28.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你亲生父亲告诉我 恐怕要跟你来世再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.18,0:08:30.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来世再见…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.81,0:08:32.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这时候恐怕已经…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.85,0:08:40.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.33,0:08:46.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸…爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:53.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.84,0:08:58.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看 爸爸 我捡了这么多松果回来…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.31,0:09:00.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.39,0:09:20.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.97,0:09:28.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么啦 草太
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.40,0:09:30.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小蚋在里面耶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.14,0:09:34.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有点怪怪的 我觉得很不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.08,0:09:36.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么啊 草太
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:38.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐…姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.25,0:09:42.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这股瘴气是…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可能 怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.53,0:09:54.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草太 你快跑 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:55.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草太 振作一点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.43,0:10:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.93,0:10:02.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么声音啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.40,0:10:04.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千万不可以过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.15,0:10:13.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续受苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.05,0:10:15.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,受完苦之后
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.15,0:10:17.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有永无止尽的绝望等着你们呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.39,0:10:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好地、慢慢地品尝那些恐怖的滋味吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:29.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死妖怪 你到底对他们做了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.67,0:10:33.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过让他们做做梦而已
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.47,0:10:35.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他们做梦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.57,0:10:37.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管人也好 妖怪也罢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.47,0:10:40.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,隐藏在内心深处的那种恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.47,0:10:43.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会借着梦境变得非常非常的具体
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:45.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而这些东西就是我们的饵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:48.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这死妖怪简直乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.69,0:10:54.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在立刻放了戈薇他们
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.19,0:10:57.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哼！ 你这只半妖
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.33,0:11:00.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看得出来 你开始感到恐惧了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.99,0:11:01.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:04.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不跟大家成群结队的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:06.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本是胆小又没用的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.83,0:11:07.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.34,0:11:10.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算剩下我一个我也照样能打
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.20,0:11:11.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只不过
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.34,0:11:15.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然拿我的同伴当成你的饵
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:16.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不能忍受
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:19.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别在那边逞英雄了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.95,0:11:32.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你最害怕最难忍受的恐惧 我也会一并吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.19,0:11:34.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你还能威风多久
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.46,0:11:37.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看招吧 风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.74,0:11:49.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呸 光会用一张嘴说说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.55,0:11:56.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为这样就算赢了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.42,0:11:57.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什…什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.75,0:11:59.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算我这条命没了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.15,0:12:02.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些不断帮我啃食他们的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.72,0:12:07.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有肉体的分身全都会复活
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.06,0:12:10.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候就是你的死期了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.90,0:12:17.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你等着成为你那些同伴的饵吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.90,0:12:23.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而到那个时候 你会第一次真正摆脱孤独的恐惧呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:31.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虫茧居然没有消失
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.19,0:12:33.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:35.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么做…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:49.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太可恶了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.56,0:12:55.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个浑蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:12:59.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.57,0:13:02.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.90,0:13:05.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒 珊瑚
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.57,0:13:11.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.51,0:13:13.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐姐 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.18,0:13:15.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我终于办到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.41,0:13:18.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一个人打败妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.05,0:13:21.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你打败妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:25.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.56,0:13:30.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次爸爸一定会夸奖我做得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:42.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,姐…姐…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.91,0:13:51.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.73,0:14:06.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是姐姐你的错哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:08.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你没有夸奖我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:13.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梦心师父 放了我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.34,0:14:14.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求求你放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.50,0:14:15.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.44,0:14:17.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那个风穴 现在已经用到极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.14,0:14:19.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以后你哪里都去不了了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.64,0:14:21.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.85,0:14:22.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一定把奈落找出来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.36,0:14:36.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明只差一步了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.86,0:14:39.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 你怎么啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.86,0:14:40.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别…别过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.36,0:14:42.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.60,0:14:43.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.73,0:14:45.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们全都不要过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.01,0:14:56.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎…怎么会… 我根本没打开
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.28,0:15:01.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒法师 你就那么想帮我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.05,0:15:05.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了帮我 牺牲同伴的性命也在所不惜吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.29,0:15:08.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切全部都是你的杰作
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.19,0:15:11.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你对我爷爷 下了这个风穴诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.71,0:15:28.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呜啊 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.81,0:15:31.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.52,0:15:34.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然在上课的时候做梦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.69,0:15:39.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么啦 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.52,0:15:42.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很少看到你上课打瞌睡耶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:45.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚刚睡得还真熟哩
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.43,0:15:48.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是因为太过用功念书啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.10,0:15:50.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是因为这种事啦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:53.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.04,0:15:59.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.34,0:16:01.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续待在这里会有危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.68,0:16:06.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.85,0:16:08.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞刃血爪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.32,0:16:14.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.93,0:16:25.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.20,0:16:26.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的韧性跑到哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.97,0:16:29.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然会被梦境给侵蚀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.47,0:16:32.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是这么脆弱的人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:35.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真的看错你了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:38.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你就这样放弃自己的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.28,0:16:41.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就要一个人自己去击败奈落
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.49,0:16:44.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到时候你可不要跟在后面哭哭啼啼的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.66,0:16:51.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.13,0:16:54.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对不可以让那只飞蛾怪吃掉你的心灵
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:07.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.38,0:17:11.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一向都不是那么柔弱的女子 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.98,0:17:12.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快醒来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.85,0:17:15.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快醒来命令我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.42,0:17:18.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,命令我坐下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.93,0:17:24.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,琥珀 原谅姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.26,0:17:26.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果不杀了你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.93,0:17:29.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这一辈子恐怕都没有机会回到我身边了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.93,0:17:30.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.43,0:17:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么 姐姐
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.27,0:17:35.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我先杀了你 然后跟你一起死
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.67,0:17:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了从奈落手中把你抢回来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.91,0:17:39.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这个办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.44,0:17:42.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:46.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绝对不能杀了琥珀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.58,0:17:47.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定要活着把他带回来才行
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.72,0:17:49.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是我在的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.19,0:17:52.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只会给大家添麻烦而已
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.79,0:17:54.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不要再咯里罗唆的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正大家在一起就是比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.26,0:17:58.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你也满会打架的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.40,0:18:01.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.54,0:18:07.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这家伙到底在怕什么
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.74,0:18:08.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.81,0:18:12.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再打开风穴的话 我会先折断你这只手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.78,0:18:16.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要等到打败奈落 风穴才能收起来对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.31,0:18:19.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是裹足不前的时候吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:22.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的一点都没错 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.49,0:18:26.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要撑下去 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.96,0:18:31.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狐火
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.33,0:18:35.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞定了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.94,0:18:42.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 看不出来你真有两下子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.24,0:18:45.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.45,0:18:56.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.35,0:18:58.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.96,0:19:01.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…身上好香啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.09,0:19:04.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这时候在说什么啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.23,0:19:07.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快跑 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.60,0:19:09.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在人类的样子打不过他的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.03,0:19:11.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.00,0:19:13.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会扔下你一个人跑掉吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.04,0:19:15.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.77,0:19:18.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会保护你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.05,0:19:30.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊 还有犬夜叉在我身边
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:35.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要还有犬夜叉在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.79,0:19:37.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有那帮好朋友在
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.83,0:19:40.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算有再大的困难我们一定都能一起克服的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.31,0:19:57.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.78,0:19:58.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.32,0:20:01.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样才是我认识的你们嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.22,0:20:03.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.09,0:20:07.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在马上可以离开这座森林了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.23,0:20:10.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出口就在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.03,0:20:15.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.50,0:20:17.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.95,0:20:33.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,森林不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:36.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为刚刚的一切都是蛾罗丸的幻术吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.35,0:20:39.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:41.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害得我们无缘无故耽误了行程
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:43.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 真的是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.56,0:20:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.76,0:20:46.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过果然是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.40,0:20:48.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果没有我在一旁
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.36,0:20:50.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们根本就软弱到不行嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.33,0:20:51.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.34,0:20:57.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干什么 有什么不满吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.97,0:20:59.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实际 你说的并没错
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.08,0:21:02.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就只限今天随便让你说说
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.88,0:21:05.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这么说是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.78,0:21:07.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就好了嘛 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:09.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都认同你够厉害不就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.72,0:21:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 这样我不接受
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.09,0:21:13.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们真的认为是我救了大家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:16.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那好歹跟我说一声“谢谢”才对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:18.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然这样 戈薇姑娘
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:21.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就麻烦你代表大家说一句话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.17,0:21:22.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.57,0:21:25.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咿呀…你想干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.64,0:21:28.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快醒来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.14,0:21:32.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,醒来命令我坐下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.21,0:21:35.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.31,0:21:36.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.68,0:21:40.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢 谢 你 哦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.62,0:21:43.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.39,0:21:44.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是过来叫我坐下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.12,0:21:45.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接下来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:46.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也该继续上路咯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.89,0:21:47.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.72,0:21:48.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个 我肚子饿了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.33,0:21:51.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂喂 戈薇 刚刚你跟我说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.13,0:21:52.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说一次啦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:54.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会再说了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:56.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又没关系 再说一次嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.83,0:21:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你烦不烦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.03,0:22:00.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么嘛 喂 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:01.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 我在叫你耶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.04,0:22:03.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啦好啦 给我坐下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.68,0:22:14.91,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}红红的太阳照亮一切{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.65,0:22:24.62,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也照遍过去和现在
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.00,0:22:34.13,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些夕阳下的想象
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.47,0:22:43.90,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这颗心真的能承担吗{\fad(0,300)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.75,0:22:48.84,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}告诉我什么办法才能
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.25,0:22:53.75,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}过得比以前更开朗吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.06,0:23:01.36,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这么做就算会让自己委屈{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.33,0:23:07.46,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}默默承受伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.84,0:23:12.24,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}会失去一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.51,0:23:19.38,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌仍会不断在我心中回荡{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.85,0:23:29.19,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真正的歌才是我的路标{\fad(0,500)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.27,0:23:52.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当年失去父亲之后
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.10,0:23:53.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有继续修行的年幼的我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.31,0:23:55.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那天一直下着雪 雪越积越多
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.01,0:23:57.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个身子都被雪淹没而动弹不得
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.04,0:23:59.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是 就在那个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.08,0:24:01.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有位好心人救了我一命
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.45,0:24:02.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是七年前
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.45,0:24:03.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你遇到的那位小雪姑娘的经过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.25,0:24:06.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个女人跟我的救命恩人很像
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.65,0:24:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道这场雪也是你的眼泪凝结而成的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.06,0:24:12.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.59,0:24:14.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七年之后 一场令人怀念的大雪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.89,0:24:16.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 这个女人根本就不是人类
